window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>After the Second Kingside War, magical folks like baker Lillie Dean are once again able to live freely and use magic openly. Lillie is taking this new freedom to heart, and has just moved to the seaside town of Silverkeep to start a brand new bakery and begin her life again.</p> <p>But all is not sweet in the idyllic village, especially when Lillie gets a threatening note saying if she doesn't get out of town, everyone will find out about her villainous past. When other magical creatures start receiving similar threats, Lillie puts on her sleuthing hat to find out who's causing all the consternation — and why they've got a vendetta against magical creatures.</p> <p>Get the first three books in this warm, inviting cozy mystery meets cozy fantasy series in a convenient eBook bundle! Includes the following novels:</p> <ol> <li>A Pinch of Change (prequel novella)</li> <li>A Drizzle of Magic</li> <li>A Splash of Arcana</li> <li>A Dash of Sorcery</li> </ol>"; 
